Native Orbis content-provider service

Usage: origin-orbis-provider [OPTIONS] --provider <PROVIDER> --public-endpoint <PUBLIC_ENDPOINT> --data-path <DATA_PATH> --capacity-bytes <CAPACITY_BYTES>

Options:
      --orbis-rpc <ORBIS_RPC>
